+  - `_PLAN_BRANCH_RX` and `_PLAN_MERGE_RX` use `re.I` without `re.ASCII`, so a homoglyph branch name (`f\u0131x-003`) maps to `FIX-003`. Main did the same for `task` (the audit, round 1; add `re.ASCII`).
